Search 3.0: WooCommerce-style product filter blocks. Adds the parent `jetpack/search-product-filters` (composable InnerBlocks wrapper) plus six filter children: `…-status` (stock status, scalar `?filter_stock_status=…` URL form), `…-rating` (1–5 star rows backed by the histogram agg), `…-price` (min/max number inputs driving `state.priceRange` via a new `setPriceRange` action), `…-attribute` (per-`pa_*` WC product attribute, picker constrained to registered product attributes), `…-taxonomy` (Category / Tag / Brand variations targeting `product_cat`, `product_tag`, `product_brand`), and `…-clear-button` (standalone clear-all affordance). The `jetpack/active-filters` block now renders product-aware chips (`Stock status: In stock`, `Rating: 5 stars`, `Price: $10 – $50`) and surfaces with a price-only selection. Builds on the data-plane helpers from [#48397]; tracked under epic [RSM-1929]. Display-variant (chips) and price-slider blocks land in a follow-up.
